Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan, and his\Ngreatest challenge yet, to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I slipped through my alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.49,0:00:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said to make sure I didn't oversleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.35,0:00:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:01:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're that eager to go to\Nschool on your day off, be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what they refer\Nto as a family meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one example of human behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.55,0:01:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, we have the\Nmixed-gender friendship exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.57,0:01:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to the art of killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Gero family taught\Nme about the lives of the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.93,0:01:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humans I would eventually\Nhave to assassinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.35,0:01:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They lived on the other side of one-way\Nmirrors, unaware of what was happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.77,0:01:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We call it the Human Zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These creatures, so fragile and\Nignorant, live at the mercy of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As heir to the Poison Clan, you'll be the\None responsible for sealing that fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:02:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The secret of the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.39,0:02:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.63,0:02:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that run?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun, fun! You suck! No, but, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For a disruptive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,False!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My. Ras.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.87,0:02:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Muscle. Pleading.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.53,0:02:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxic! Audience. Puisquade.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.32,0:02:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vert.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxic
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.23,0:02:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm always here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.23,0:02:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm strange enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:02:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.77,0:03:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.95,0:03:52.23,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnImpact\an8\fs46\shad2\bord0.5\c&H8F83F3&\3c&H2A292C&\4c&H2A292C&}Modified Bloodline++: Hell's Lashes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.23,0:03:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, Hell's Lashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.87,0:04:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skin gives me the unique ability\Nto bend any fluid to my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me demonstrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.21,0:04:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, did I accidentally\Nhit an innocent bystander?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll compensate you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I would if you\Nwere going to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pei, are you going to be alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why go this far for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.85,0:04:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because it's our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.67,0:04:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in Kero's eyes, you're\Nmore than just a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what does that mean?\NJust run. Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.93,0:04:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only have one priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ensuring your safe escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Gero and I need a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:04:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.83,0:04:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me how I\Ncan help you out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost my supply of needles and\Npoisons after that hit. Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that flailing is making it\Nimpossible to get close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.13,0:05:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Hikaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must never allow yourself to engage\Na master for less than five billion yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only agree if victory is\Nabsolutely guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.59,0:05:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A master must not risk exposing his arts,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what we call modified\Nbloodline increments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.45,0:05:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, if someone learns your secrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you must kill them\Nwithout any hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their death will both preserve the\NPoison Master's legacy and build upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special delivery for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, uh, what? For why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:06:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the Water Master would have\Nknocked it out of the air if I'd thrown it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.45,0:06:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I dove in to make\Nsure it made the journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm rescuing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have used the opportunity\Nand left when you had the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name's Gero, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll break this down for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you stormed in here,\Nknight and shining armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you couldn't tell, I'm\Nnot exactly princess material.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.55,0:06:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In short, I'm the one who's rescuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all that, you leap into danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No idea what's going through your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shouldn't have bothered\Nwith shielding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.91,0:06:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt you're a definite shoe-in for\Nthis year's least worth saving award.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.35,0:06:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how does it feel risking your life for an\Nidiot and dying for absolutely nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.23,0:06:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:56.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for setting me up with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it was Himekawa,\Nand she was my first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop that syringe or the girl gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's empty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I didn't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he sneak up behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.87,0:07:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't control the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.91,0:07:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll call you the next\Ntime my sink's clogged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made a horrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:07:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my hand in a no-touch zone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.97,0:08:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like it was intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I basically had no choice, and it's the\Nback of my hand, so I don't think it counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.81,0:08:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.49,0:08:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're allergic to clean air, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why your suit's filled with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To keep you from being exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I read about it in the\NPoison Master's library.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made a cream to alleviate the symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.89,0:08:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apply as needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.69,0:08:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.61,0:08:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you pity me? As if.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.97,0:08:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hammering the final\Nnail in your coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.53,0:08:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.57,0:08:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm curing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll teach you to\Nnever mess with me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not profitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losing, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'll never, ever be bad again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would hope not.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.01,0:09:26.32,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\an8\bord3\shad0\blur0.3\fax-0.06\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\fscx90\c&H4C9996&\3c&HAEB9BA&\frz3.398\pos(343.43,212.57)}Takeru Shiratori
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.01,0:09:26.32,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\an8\bord1\shad0\blur0.3\fax-0.06\fnGeorgia\b1\fs10\fscx90\c&H4C9996&\3c&H253C42&\frz3.398\pos(343.43,212.57)}Takeru Shiratori
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.01,0:09:26.32,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\an8\bord3\shad0\blur0.3\fax-0.06\fnGeorgia\b1\fs8\fscx90\c&H4C9996&\3c&HAEB9BA&\frz3.398\pos(368.57,250.86)}Critters\Nvs.\NBodies
Dialogue: 2,0:09:22.01,0:09:26.32,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\an8\bord1\shad0\blur0.3\fax-0.06\fnGeorgia\b1\fs8\fscx90\c&H4C9996&\3c&H253C42&\frz3.398\pos(368.57,250.86)}Critters\Nvs.\NBodies
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, your legitimate exhibits\Nare pretty baller, so focus on those.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing but an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.15,0:09:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're letting him off with a\Nwarning instead of finishing the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.23,0:09:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A master kills and leaves no loose ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he dares to cross me again, then\Nhe'll get my Thousand Torments toxin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Letting him go may seem wishy-washy\Nto you, but I don't kill for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.29,0:09:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that okay with you, Himekawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm never letting my guard down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.61,0:09:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you didn't get it when\NI introduced my shark butt, Chomsky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:06.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously he's a shark who's my butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Chompsky?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Mom. We missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.47,0:10:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Critics didn't think much\Nof Egg while he was alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.39,0:10:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He let go of most of his\Nworks! All of them! That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.19,0:10:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you hiding in the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.31,0:10:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No reason not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.15,0:10:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My late wife tragically passed away in a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,traffic accident shortly\Nafter we had Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.98,0:10:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could sell the painting\Nand live a carefree
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life in a nice house off\Nthe proceeds we'd make.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.99,0:10:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But instead...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:59.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd rather keep our family together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Gero, get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.43,0:11:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akiha wants to say thank you. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.93,0:11:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut out the lone wolf act.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.67,0:11:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing wrong\Nwith being appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.97,0:11:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, humility just comes off as rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiya, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.27,0:11:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to say thank\Nyou for rescuing my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.85,0:11:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gero,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I heard you were a poison master,\NI figured you'd be a real piece of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess you're an\Nexception to the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was waiting for the right\Ntime to thank you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.47,0:11:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother, Okto?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got that operation you helped pay for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.19,0:11:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still recovering, but he's got the\Nenergy to send me dumb selfies every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.49,0:11:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell him he's supposed to be\Nresting like he listens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're willing\Nto risk your life for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.31,0:11:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That family?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may call his gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.37,0:12:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even my little brother,\Nthey're all able to smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize what you've\Ndone is truly wonderful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.87,0:12:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.78,0:12:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do some cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you go, we never\Ndiscussed your reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, there aren't enough organs\Nbetween us to pay for the work you put in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd obviously love to\Noffer you some money,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.61,0:12:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we're also kind of strapped for cash
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you anything\Nelse you want though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.03,0:12:28.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just name it
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is Kinosaki\Npicking out what to wear again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long does that take?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case Himekawa come over and celebrate\Nwith us three hotties out on the town.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.98,0:13:04.57,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\an8\b1\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs15\fax0.4\c&H7D8485&\pos(416,21.14)}Sorry! I'm on\N\h\h\hanother date\N\h\h\h\h\hright now
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.57,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\an8\b1\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs20\fax0.46\fay-0.02\c&H6B6C69&\pos(395,160)}Anyway, I'm sure you'll do fine
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.50,0:13:04.57,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\an8\b1\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs22\fax0.46\fay-0.02\c&H545250&\pos(392,270)}Break a leg!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.57,0:13:05.95,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\fnArial Black\an8\b1\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs22\fax0.46\fay-0.01\c&H1F201E&\pos(380,196)\frx12\fry4}I know you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just the two of us.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.27,0:13:17.00,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs28\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,280)}My {\alpha&HFF&\t(125,126,\alpha&H00&)}First
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no clue what I\Nwas getting myself into.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shark! Shark! Shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.27,0:13:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shark!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.08,0:13:37.94,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an7\b1\fnGeorgia\bord0.5\shad3\blur0.3\fs50\fscy140\fscx90\c&H2C2462&\3c&H0C0807&\pos(22,208)}Predation
