Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.99,0:13:47.95,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\fs40\fsp8\bord10\shad4\frz13.64\3c&H82FDFB&\c&HB292EC&\pos(195,170)}Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Operation White Knight,\NGero saved Himekawa from her captors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.81,0:13:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his likability at an all-time high,\Nhe managed to wrangle a date with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:13:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell her how you\Nfeel and seal the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.41,0:14:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he spotted me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.47,0:14:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have expected any\Nless from a master assassin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.19,0:14:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rule number one, subsection three\Nof the Kinosaki School of Dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't know what to talk about,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,complimenting something cute she's\Nwearing will work every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shows you have an interest in her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.69,0:14:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's covered in stuff you can bring up.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.16,0:14:28.41,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\blur0.3\c&H212121&\move(125,223,125,176,400,1220)}Pretty earrings
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty earrings, a lovely necklace,\Nher cute nails, or that stylish jacket.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.28,0:14:31.24,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\blur0.3\c&H212121&\move(558,290,558,62)}Lovely\Nnecklace
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.41,0:14:30.62,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\blur0.3\c&H212121&\move(125,174,125,-10)}Pretty earrings
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.74,0:14:32.41,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\blur0.3\c&H212121&\move(400,250,400,68)}Cute nails
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.63,0:14:32.41,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\blur0.3\c&H212121&\move(55,364,55,262)}Stylish \Njacket
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.41,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\fs18\blur0.3\c&H212121&\move(558,62,558,-10)}Lovely\Nnecklace
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.81,0:14:36.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that necklace of yours. Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.03,0:14:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks kind of old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it an heirloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Himekawa's speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it came with a flea\Nmarket dehumidifier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could have seen that coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a perfect combo starter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flea market dehumidifier\Nthat came with their jewelry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.93,0:14:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's tons of follow-ups for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you cut your bangs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look at him and Akari,\Nnot me! Gero, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. All that hard work\Nwinning her over down the drain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not going to\Neat that, then give me it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.59,0:15:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing Himekawa's so easygoing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love these.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say love? Red alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No choice. I've got to lend a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.79,0:15:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or the state is thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.41,0:15:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be a Greenland shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you know so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, it's that support shark app.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.33,0:15:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That they shut down due\Nto horrible user reviews.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.87,0:15:41.18,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.3\fs12\fay0.01\c&H3F5A53&\pos(221.71,84.57)}Tell her {\alpha&HFF&\t(42,43,\alpha&H00&)}a whale {\alpha&HFF&\t(85,86,\alpha&H00&)}of a {\alpha&HFF&\t(125,126,\alpha&H00&)}tale
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.98,0:15:41.18,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.3\fs12\fay0.01\c&H3F5A53&\pos(212,115)}about {\alpha&HFF&\t(55,56,\alpha&H00&)}your {\alpha&HFF&\t(100,101,\alpha&H00&)}childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you know so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It even makes whale puns! Excuse me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's off-limits for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.79,0:15:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the harm?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.07,0:15:58.28,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.3\fs7\c&H83925D&\pos(131,47)}Tell her a whale of a tale
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.07,0:15:58.28,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.3\fs7\c&H83925D&\pos(126.29,80)}about your childhood
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.21,0:15:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help but notice\Nyou barely touched your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.99,0:15:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.83,0:16:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't eat anything\Nsomeone else has made.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's become second nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far back as I'm able to remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done nothing but\Ntrain as a Poison Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as food's concerned, all that\Nmatters is whether it's poisoned or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always prepared my own\Nmeals and ate them alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.81,0:16:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some restraint! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.67,0:16:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went through something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire time I was\Ngrowing up, I was also alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.11,0:16:34.45,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.3\fs15\fay0.02\c&H83925D&\pos(342,92)}You'd bet-orca
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.11,0:16:34.45,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.3\fs15\fay0.02\c&H83925D&\pos(336.57,153.71)}listen to her
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.83,0:16:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any family, and\Nmaking friends wasn't easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one day, a rich guy nearing\Nthe end of his life adopted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I think he would\Nhave been happy with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.35,0:16:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the end was approaching,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.15,0:16:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he realized he hadn't left a legacy\Nbehind, and it terrified him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.81,0:17:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I inherited the Himekawa name,\Nnot to mention a huge fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A life of luxury awaited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.19,0:17:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until I saw the room covered floor\Nto ceiling with crying portraits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did some digging and found out\Nhe'd gotten them illegitimately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.09,0:17:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were alone like me,\Ncompletely out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.39,0:17:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, I returned them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time the gallery was empty,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Himekawa fortune had been\Neaten up from all my expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.05,0:17:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These days, I work part-time five\Ndays a week to make ends meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.01,0:17:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to admit, it's\Nkind of ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.57,0:17:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.65,0:17:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that job, it was the first time\Nsomeone's ever genuinely thanked me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:18:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's all because of the work you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so dedicated. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.47,0:18:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never met anyone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it something I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody's sung my praises like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sort of embarrassing.
