Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.03,0:18:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shark! Shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something I want to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.97,0:19:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me, how would you\Nfeel about being friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.99,0:19:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking? Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was your big chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had me going there.\NJust friends? Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to ask me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'd like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.35,0:19:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only, to be very blunt, I don't\Nknow the first thing about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Similarly, you don't know\Nthe first thing about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.05,0:19:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I might have made a\Ngood impression earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.57,0:19:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's just how I seem on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.47,0:19:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep down, there are parts\Nof me that are so rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.91,0:20:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want us to share more\Nexperiences together first,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so little by little you can\Nget to know the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, if you still think\NI'd be a good match for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll make that proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.31,0:20:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since that would be the first step in\Nfinding the happy marriage I'm looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what you meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want this to start\Noff as a friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize you just spilled\Nthe beans on your whole plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I meant to say\Nwas... I'm in. Be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.87,0:20:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.11,0:20:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stealing my heart won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I figured you and\NKinosaki were a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.05,0:20:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki is my marriage\Nadvisor. Is that all?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.79,0:20:57.25,Default,Signs,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs18\fax-0.32\b1\pos(249,207)\c&H2A2922&\frz358.1}Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.77,0:21:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Himekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you can't eat\Nfood other people make,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.15,0:21:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time, how about\Nyou handle our lunches?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heads up, I'm big on rolled omelets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good news, Ghetto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bodyguard now for this cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.61,0:21:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the only daughter of a big-time CEO.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.47,0:21:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to be human scum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.97,0:21:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just made a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it comes to women, Himekawa's\Nthe only one you really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a great big sea out\Nthere full of millions of fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.83,0:21:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinds you've never heard of!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting to know a lot of\Ngirls will help you see their
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.09,0:21:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good points clearly and\Nlearn to like them even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.15,0:22:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Himekawa really is the one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.55,0:22:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe it's someone\Nyou haven't even met yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.65,0:22:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whoever they turn out to be, I want\Nyou to have the best marriage possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.07,0:22:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.67,0:22:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.13,0:23:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be creepy. Oh, make a noise. I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.05,0:23:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.07,0:23:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.19,0:23:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,improve myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.41,0:23:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who can cook attracts triple the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daigo Oshima, economics\Nmajor. My lucky stars.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.22,0:23:56.27,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(320,278)}The Sound Master
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.71,0:23:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, the Sound Master.

